# be-architect #1 · Bonsai 2 4B vs 9B benchmark (PLAYBOOK §2.2) · 2026-11-14 (UTC 22:34–22:56)

Machine: Apple M4, 24 GB, macOS 15.7.3. Server: PrismML llama.cpp fork, samples/bonsai-models/gguf/bin/macos-arm64/llama-server
(started by start.sh: -ngl 99 -fa on -c 32768, n_slots = 4 auto, host 127.0.0.1). Client: node v24.13.0, non-streaming
/v1/chat/completions, enable_thinking=false, sampling sent per request (temperature 0.7, top_p 0.8, top_k 20, min_p 0,
presence_penalty 1.5, repetition_penalty 1.0; mood call: temperature 0, top_k 1). Scripts: be-architect-1-bench-scripts.log.
Raw per-turn output: be-architect-1-bench-raw-4B.log, be-architect-1-bench-raw-9B.log.

