## Correctness
| model | variant | FX-004 mood (2 rounds) | reply language = line language | context recalled in turn 2 (en / zh, manual read) |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 4B | single v1 | 8/10, 8/10 | 34/34 | 0/1, 0/1 |
| 4B | single v3 | 8/10, 8/10 | 32/32 | 0/3, 0/3 |
| 4B | two-call | 8/10, 8/10 | 42/42 | 0/3, 1/3 |
| 9B | single v1 | 8/10, 8/10 | 34/34 | 0/1, 0/1 |
| 9B | single v2 | 8/10, 8/10 | 32/32 | 0/3, 0/3 |
| 9B | single v3 | 8/10, 8/10 | 32/32 | 1/3 ("moving is hard even when it's exciting"), 1/3 ("刚开心的事又被破坏了") |
| 9B | two-call | 9/10, 9/10 | 42/42 | 3/3 ("I remember you just got the internship!"…), 3/3 ("虽然考完试很开心，但…") |
Misses: every miss in every variant is the neutral line: "嗯，刚到家。" -> pleasant-low (all variants); "Hmm, just got home." ->
pleasant-low (all except 9B two-call, which got it right 2/2).
Thinking text in replies: 0 in every run (content had no <think>, reasoning_content empty).
Shape: replies over 2 sentences in every variant (e.g. 9B two-call 11/42, counting "!" as a sentence end), over 1 question
up to 5/32 (4B); none over the length caps (zh 120 chars, en 40 words). -> the server must shape replies (03 DES-007).
Emoji appeared in some two-call replies ("🎉"); left as is.

## Recommendation
Bonsai 2 9B, two parallel calls per turn (free-text reply + enum mood at temperature 0).
Why: the only variant meeting REQ-007 (6/6 vs at most 2/6 elsewhere) and the best mood score (9/10). Warm turn ~1.0 s.
Cost: a cold 20-turn prompt takes 6.4–8.7 s; with STT ~2 s that can pass 10 s (REQ-008) only when the prompt cache is cold.
Fallback if REQ-008 fails in build: BONSAI_MODEL=4B (cold 3.9–4.1 s), knowing context recall drops (1/6 here).
